        objectivesES = {
            "Talk to Lansu",
            "'Off you go! Say hi to Viznak for me!'",
            "'So, you want to get to Seregost? I suppose I can help with that.'\n\nCompleting this quest will unlock access to the Bloody Watchers in Agarnaith and the Seregost level 115 area.",
