            "Clear fallen rocks as you search for trapped explorers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})",
            "Regroup with the rescued Longbeards",
            "Rescue the first trapped Longbeard",
            "Everyone is rescued and accounted for!",
            "Miniaventura: El clan Zhélruka, capítulo 4",
            "Rescued the first trapped Longbeard",
            "Rescued the second trapped Longbeard",
            "Cleared fallen rocks (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})",
            "Regroup with the rescued Longbeards.",
            "'We thank you, brave ${CLASS}. Without your assistance we would certainly be done for. I believe I speak for all of us when I say that we are ready to return to safer dwellings whenever you are!'",
