            "Place hobgoblin totems in the Orc encampment (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})",
            "Destroy provisions at the Orc encampment (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})",
            "Continue work to sabotage both the Orc encampment and the hobgoblin encampment.",
